{"c":[{"name":"20260820T025220Z-1a52749b783612ee","text":"docs-sunset plan: VISION/ROADMAP retire; architecture lives at docs/architecture/; leftovers (sqlite, hooks, cover(T), pack-size, hot margin) at docs/notes.md; README is the public face.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260820T030457Z-f1b0d73acb7f8b59","text":"VISION.md and ROADMAP.md are gone. Living docs are README, docs/architecture/, docs/notes.md, and the memory-bank. The architecture page is the atlas; VISION is not the contract.","type":"note"}]}
